6.1.evidence:
1. Implementation of protection for women victims of Disasters in order to provide protection during Disasters and post-Disaster.
3. Women victims of Disasters as referred to in paragraph (1) receive protection for:
access to proper temporary shelter;
guarantee of security;
providing women-friendly space facilities, as well as Gender-responsive facilities and infrastructure in emergency response and rehabilitation conditions that accommodate local resources;

6.1.evidence_original:
1. Pelaksanaan perlindungan bagi perempuan korban Bencana dalam rangka memberikan perlindungan saat Bencana dan pasca Bencana.

3. Perempuan korban Bencana sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) mendapat perlindungan atas:

akses tempat tinggal sementara yang layak;

jaminan rasa aman;

menyediakan fasilitas ruang ramah Perempuan, serta sarana dan prasarana yang responsif Gender pada kondisi tanggap darurat dan rehabilitasi yang mengakomodasi sumber daya lokal;
